{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50501","headline":"题谢处士山斋 · 宋之问","name":"题谢处士山斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"那有唐年客，青山独闭门。\n云泉一少事，琴史皆忘喧。\n在濬人犹絷，迁乔友未言。\n不知幽谷草，何意老王孙？\n（此诗见《永乐大典》卷二五三九「七皆」「斋」字「山斋」条。\n〖三函三十册〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}